  "notes": "Independent copy, absent source paths; bad report/slide values, missing binding, rounding edge, corrupt snapshot and changed live source rejected. All six figures and three Q2.2 replay outputs regenerate byte-identically. C21b per-run fields match the pinned original analyse function in all eight floor/window settings. Locked-test run metrics/contrasts match pinned original functions on the real cohort and a tied calculator fixture; full B=2000 replay matches all selected saved results. The Q1.4 raw-grid output regenerates byte-identically; all pair scores, cohort loading and full bootstraps match original functions. The scripted gate reaggregates all nine archived detector caches with original-function parity and boundary/tie/leave-one-out calculator checks. A separate pCMI replay reconstructs all historical shift draws, scores and p-values from frozen trajectories, with original full-score-function parity on ten group representatives and constant/short fixtures; no markets are generated. Malformed completed trajectories and missing, duplicate and invalid audit/cache inputs are rejected."
